  "releaseNotes": "- Database exports can now be retrieved directly through the client using the new GetDbExportsAsync and GetDbExportStreamAsync methods. Reading the actual CSV files is still part of the Noppes.E621Client.DbExport package.\n- Removed the TagHelper class. Tags passed to GetPostsAsync are no longer parsed and the limit of 40 tags is no longer enforced by the library.\n- E621Client is now sealed and its protected Dispose(bool) method has been removed.\n- NuGet dependencies have been upgraded to their latest versions.",
